cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DentRx, please cite it and the underlying clinical guideline(s) you rely on."
title: "DentRx: an open, guideline-cited dental prescribing reference (antibiotics & analgesics)"
abstract: >-
  DentRx encodes published dental prescribing guidance — acute-pain analgesia,
  infective-endocarditis and prosthetic-joint antibiotic prophylaxis, and
  therapeutic antibiotics for pulpal/periapical infection — as a tested,
  versioned, citation-linked dataset with a recommendation engine, spanning US
  (ADA/AHA/AAOS/FDA/AAPD) and UK (SDCEP/NICE/BNF) guidance for adults and
  children. It is an educational reference, not a prescription.
type: software
authors:
